(to the necks; make a gentle fire till they are a little codled and) Tj T*
(turn white; do not take them up till cold, then pitch the corks all) Tj T*
(over, or wax them close and thick; then set them in a cool dry cellar.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_To preserve Peaches_.) Tj T*
