() Tj T*
(Take the weight of the currants in sugar, pick out the seeds; take to) Tj T*
(a pound of sugar, half a pint of water, let it melt; then put in your) Tj T*
(currants and let them do very leisurely, skim them, and take them up,) Tj T*
